 ce of the Palestinians in a review of a book on the 1982 Lebanon war. Film
 ed live onstage at the Harold Pinter Theatre in London's West End in 2025.
 \n\nStarring: John Lithgow\, Elliot Levey\, Aya Cash\, Rachael Stirling\, 
