 ollaboration between actor and director soon threatens to unravel.\n\nStar
 ring: Johnny Flynn\, Mark Gatiss\, Tuppence Middleton\, Aysha Kala\, Luke 
 Norris\, Allan Corduner\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\nBook ti
